SUMMARY:Mostra of Thymiana (carnival)
LOCATION:Thymiana\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Chios's famous carnival custom\, listed in the national intangible-heritage register: on Carnival Sunday (the last Sunday before Clean Monday) Thymiana\, just south of Chios town\, re-enacts the villagers' victory over pirates with the 'talimi' sword dance and a procession of masked 'Mostres'\, now combined with a float parade. Run by the MEOTH association over the last carnival weekend\, with thousands attending including visitors from Turkey. Go early\, the village roads are closed.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#thymiana-mostra-of-thymiana-carnival
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#thymiana-mostra-of-thymiana-carnival
END:VEVENT
